# The Gaia ECS pin shared by VIXEN, undertow and the kernel (owner rulings R668.5, R668.7).
# This is the Lint111 fork of richardbiely/gaia-ecs: the upstream stack pin a2e62491 plus two commits
# (31 SoA members, 65535-byte SoA members). The second commit repacks the raw Component::value() bits
# (size 13 -> 16 bits, alignment stored as log2+1); Component::size()/alig() are unchanged.
#
# Same flat form as undertow's toolchain/providers/*.pin: 'sha:', 'branch:' and 'remote:' lines,
# '#' comments ignored. VIXEN's CMake reads this file; undertow and the kernel keep a byte-identical
# copy at toolchain/providers/gaia.pin. Change all three in one batch.
